::DROP-CREATE-TRUNCATE::
Which of the following deletes all rows and the table itself.
{
    ~TRUNCATE
    =DROP
    ~REMOVE
    ~ALTER
}

::DROP-CREATE-TRUNCATE::
Which of the following generates a new empty table in the database.
{
    =CREATE TABLE
    ~DROP TABLE
    ~TRUNCATE TABLE
    ~ALTER TABLE
}

::DROP-CREATE-TRUNCATE::
MySQL requires _____ privilege to drop a table.
{
    =DROP
    ~ALTER
    ~DROP ANY TABLE
    ~UPDATE
}
